(i) To thaw human ESCs in feeder-free conditions, follow Step 1A(iv–viii), substituting mTeSR1 for human ESC medium (except in Step 1A(iv)), and substituting Matrigel-coated plates (prepared as detailed in the Equipment Setup) for MEF-containing plates. Washing Matrigel-coated plates with PBS is not required before use.
