(vi) Divide the remaining early-passage parthenogenetic ESC suspension into $15-\mathsf{m l}$ tubes with $10~\mathrm{ml}$ per tube (for exam­ ple, if three plates were initially used in Step 2B(i), resuspend the cell pellet in $30~\mathsf{m l}$ of medium and divide the cell suspension into three $15-\mathsf{m l}$ tubes).
